920","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update Ahead of Steam Next Fest","summary":"Hi everyone!I’ve recently made some updates to the demo, including:A new UI: I hope the updated interface makes your time with the game feel more immersive.A new item and Prestige skills: The Buzzsaw joins the action to help you destroy the world! Two new Prestige skills, Moneybag and Destruction Maniac, also add more replayability to the demo.Improvements to controls and translations: These changes should make the game clearer and easier to understand.Many other small tweaks and improvements.I'","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T08:11:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067935672","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4710920-1842846814446118","game_id":"steam-4710920","kind":"announcement","title":"Spin Your Tops. Break the World——Incretop Demo is release now!","summary":"Spin Your Tops. Break the World. The Incretop Demo Is Out Now!Hi everyone! The demo for Incretop, an incremental game about spinning tops, is now available. Come give it a spin!It all starts with a whip. Keep your tops spinning to earn coins, then invest in upgrades, skills, and items to push things further. Go from whipping tops by hand to watching combinations of effects fill the field—all while your earnings grow and the world beneath you starts to crack.Here’s what you can explore in the dem","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T11:07:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814446118","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4710920-1838407329264865","game_id":"steam-4710920","kind":"announcement","title":"Incretop Playtest Now Open","summary":"The playtest for Incretop is now available.Incretop is a short incremental physics game about whipping spinning tops, earning gold, upgrading your setup, buying strange interactive items, and slowly breaking the world apart.A typical playtest run takes around 20-30 minutes. During the test, you will:Whip tops to keep them spinningEarn gold through motion, collisions, and item effectsBuy upgrades to make your tops stronger, faster, and more chaoticUnlock playful field items and interact with them","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-20T07:09:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329264865","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4710920":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:41:10Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T03:41:09Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4710920":"2026-10-26T03:41:10Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4710920":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:41:09Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:41:09Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4733010":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:41:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:41:10Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4710920","app_id":4710920,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:48Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"64efcb76494053371135470b0f744367c8afbb587836f8e82d8287a8c3e22404","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"IncreTop은 채찍으로 팽이를 치는 인크리멘털 게임입니다. 신비한 비디오테이프에 갇힌 당신은 TV 화면 속 다양한 팽이를 쳐서 돈을 벌고, 업그레이드를 구매하고, 스킬을 배우고, 강력한 아이템을 해금합니다. 테이프 속 세계를 하나씩 파괴하며 탈출할 방법을 찾으세요.","publishers":[